# Shell scripts run on Linux (Pi kiosk/media-agent installers). CRLF breaks the shebang line
# there — CLAUDE.md's own standing rule. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout
# (the desktop this project is normally worked from) would silently convert them to CRLF on
# checkout, with nothing here catching it before it reaches a Pi.
*.sh text eol=lf
